  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Sắp xếp mẫu số liệu theo thứ tự không giảm ta được:<br><div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>39</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>43</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>71</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>85</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>85</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>85</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>89</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>117</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>122</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>142</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>148</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>162</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>167</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>168</mn><mo>;</mo></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>175</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>187</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>187</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>193</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>195</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>198</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>205</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>223</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>224</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>233</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>234</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>253</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>277</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>280</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>298</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tCỡ mẫu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là số chẵn nên trung vị của mẫu số liệu này là \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>15</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>16</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>168</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>175</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>171</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tTứ phân vị thứ nhất là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>89</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tứ phân vị thứ ba là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>23</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>223</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Bảng tần số ghép nhóm của mẫu số liệu như sau:\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Thời gian (phút)</td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>120</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>180</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>240</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>240</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>300</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td>Số sinh viên</td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>7</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>7</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n\t\t\tGọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>30</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> là mẫu số liệu được xếp theo thứ tự không giảm.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>9</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>120</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>16</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>180</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>17</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>26</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>240</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>27</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>36</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>240</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>300</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tứ phân vị thứ hai của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>15</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>16</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>15</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>16</mn></msub></semantics></math> thuộc nhóm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>180</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên tứ phân vị thứ hai của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>30</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>120</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1200</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>171</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>43</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tTứ phân vị thứ nhất của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>120</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó, tứ phân vị thứ nhất của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>30</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>60</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>750</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>107</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tTứ phân vị thứ ba của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>23</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>240</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó, tứ phân vị thứ ba của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>240</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>180</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>219</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li></ol>",
